   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP - water govern, ph 1, 2009-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;dets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att bidra till en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;trad vattenhantering i de l&#xe4;nder som ing&#xe5;r samt att lyfta viktiga regionala fr&#xe5;gor g&#xe4;llande hantering av delade vattenresurser. Dessutom ska ett flertal studier g&#xf6;ras som bakgrund till rapporten &quot;Arab Water Assessment Report&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to better govern scarce water resources in the Arab region and to discuss common development challenges in a regional context regarding the management of shared water resources. Studies will be conducted for the production of a &quot;Arab Water Assessment Report&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
